few questions to\nlearn the student's grade,\ngoals and start date", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_5", "originalText": "3 - It asks a few questions to\nlearn the student's grade,\ngoals and start date", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "diamond_7", "type": "diamond", "x": 956, "y": 60, "width": 320, "height": 140, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "#ffe89a", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 1796035740, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300026768, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_8"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_32"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_33"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_35"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_8", "type": "text", "x": 1031.0, "y": 86.25, "width": 170, "height": 88, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1033639717, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 389609434, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - Does the\nquestion need a real\nperson, like a\ncomplaint or a\nspecial case?", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 14, "containerId": "diamond_7", "originalText": "4 - Does the\nquestion need a real\nperson, like a\ncomplaint or a\nspecial case?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1324, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opac